Rule 10 (both dividend and divisor tensors are integer types with identical shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5 ∧ ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
